  "summary": {
    "text": "Claude Opus 4.5 is a language model in Anthropic's Opus line that accepts text and images, with a 200K-token context window, extended thinking and an effort parameter for trading thoroughness against token use. It is offered in the Claude apps, on the Anthropic API, Amazon Bedrock, Google Cloud Vertex AI and Microsoft Foundry, at a lower price than earlier Opus models.",
